yle: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12.25px; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 16px;\"><u style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration: inherit;\"><strong style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; background-color: #ffff00;\">2027</span></strong> Age groups that will participate in the program for 2028 Consideration.  Athletes participate in a local identifier and are then invited to the National Selection Event(NSE) to be evaluated amongst their peers from across the US.  At the NSE the top athletes in each age group are recognized and are part of the pool of athletes considered for age eligible National Teams.</span></u></span></p>\n<p style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; color: #666666; text-decoration-line: inherit; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-size: 12.25px; font-family: Lato, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 16px; font-family: helvetica;\"> <br/>U-